  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.19 - Production release with enhanced stability and performance. Complete fire-and-forget async pattern using System.Threading.Channels for lock-free queue processing. Circuit breaker implementation with Polly v8 for resilient API communication. Multi-target support for .NET 6.0, 8.0, and 9.0 with framework-specific installation paths. Enhanced logging with startup tracing for troubleshooting. Comprehensive documentation including configuration reference, architecture deep dive, and troubleshooting guides. Updated NuGet package metadata for better discoverability and professional presentation.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
